guide forever/class/mage/arcane-refreshment
title Conjure Water (Arcane Refreshment)
category Class
class Mage
folder Mage
levels 60-60
zone Feralas
keywords Arcane Refreshment, Conjure Water, Lorekeeper Lydros, Athenaeum, Hydrospawn, Hydrospawn Essence, Warpwood Quarter, Dire Maul, Shen'dralar, Mage, class spell
reward spell 10140 "Conjure Water"
reward text Shen'dralar reputation
why The level 60 Conjure Water, from a Dire Maul library: drink for you and your group.

# Arcane Refreshment (7463), both factions: Lorekeeper Lydros in Dire Maul's
# Athenaeum teaches Conjure Water (spell 10140) for the Hydrospawn Essence.
# Level 60: the Forever beta stops at 30 until launch on 4 November, so this
# guide is based on data, not play.
# Forever status: not on Forever's Mage class quest list, but Forever's
# quest data has it (quest 7463, checked
# 2026-10-14: the objective, Conjure Water and 200 Shen'dralar reputation) and
# quests.json has it from questie-forever.
# Sources: quests.json for the quest; codex/instances.json for Hydrospawn as a
# Dire Maul East boss; objects.json for the Meeting Stone in Feralas
# (57.97,44.48), the point the arrow uses for Dire Maul (our data has no spawns
# for Lydros or Hydrospawn); travel.json for the Feralas flight points; the
# quest text for the Warpwood Quarter. A Classic mage class quest guide
# (2023-11-09) fills in the way to the library (the West wing, or the
# North wing with a Crescent Key) and Hydrospawn's pool (below the satyr room
# where Pusillin turns to fight).
# data/local/mechanics (quest-steps and quest-notes, checked 2026-10-20):
# Hydrospawn (level 57 elite) casts Riptide on everyone within 10 yards,
# Submersion and Massive Geyser, calls Hydrolings at 25%, takes no frost
# damage, and is gone until the instance resets; the North doors need the
# Crescent Key or a Powerful Seaforium Charge (Blink no longer gets past);
# the quest can be shared between mages.
# Dungeon work: Dire Maul, groups of five, level 55-60.
# Left out: The Arcanist's Cookbook (7500) starts from a book that drops in
# Dire Maul and its reward is an item Forever's quest data cannot name (#18468).

step Lorekeeper Lydros
  tip Fly to Feathermoon (Alliance) or Camp Mojache (Horde) and ride to Dire Maul in central Feralas. Lorekeeper Lydros waits in the Athenaeum, the library, reached through the West wing, or through the North wing's courtyard doors with a Crescent Key (it drops from the imp Pusillin in the East wing; a Powerful Seaforium Charge also opens them; Blink no longer gets past). Other mages in your group can take it too: share it.
  level 60
  accept 7463 @58.0,44.5                      -- Lorekeeper Lydros

step Hydrospawn
  tip Hydrospawn, a level 57 elite water elemental, lives in the Warpwood Quarter (Dire Maul East): chase the imp Pusillin until he turns to fight, clear the satyr room, then take the spiral ramp down to the pool. A group of five. Frost does nothing to him, so frost mages switch to fire or arcane. Riptide hits everyone within 10 yards, so ranged stand back; at a quarter health he calls Hydrolings. The essence always drops; he does not come back until the instance resets.
  collect 18299 quest 7463.1 @58.0,44.5 group 5 -- Hydrospawn Essence: Hydrospawn

step Back to Lydros
  turnin 7463 @58.0,44.5                      -- Lorekeeper Lydros: Conjure Water, and 200 Shen'dralar reputation
